#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:27
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis computes a survival curve for censored data using the Kaplan-"
"Meier estimator for single-event survival data. It estimates the probability "
"of survival over time, allowing you to understand and visualize the "
"distribution of survival times within your data. The analysis accommodates "
"censored observations (subjects for whom the event has not occurred during "
"the study period) and enables comparison of survival curves across different "
"groups using statistical tests such as the Log-Rank test, Peto and Peto "
"test, and Fleming-Harrington test. Additionally, you can generate life "
"tables to summarize survival data at specified intervals."
msgstr ""
"この分析は、単一イベントの生存データに対してKaplan-Meier推定量を用い、打ち切"
"りのあるデータの生存曲線を計算します。時間経過に伴う生存確率を推定し、データ"
"に含まれる生存時間の分布を把握して可視化できます。打ち切られた観測(調査期間中"
"にイベントが起こらなかった対象)を扱うことができ、ログランク検定、Peto and "
"Peto検定、Fleming-Harrington検定といった統計的検定を使って、グループ間で生存"
"曲線を比較できます。さらに、指定した区間ごとに生存データを要約した生命表を作"
"成できます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:39
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "イベントまでの時間"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:42
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs."
msgstr "イベントの発生または打ち切りまでの時間を表す変数を選びます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:49
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "イベントの状態"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:52
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr ""
"イベントの状態を示す変数を選びます。各観測がイベントなのか打ち切りなのかを指"
"定するものです。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:58
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "イベントの指示値"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:61
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr ""
"イベントが発生したことを示す値を、イベントの状態の変数の中から指定します。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:68
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata"
msgstr "層"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:70
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to define strata, allowing separate survival curves for "
"each stratum."
msgstr "層を定める変数を選びます。層ごとに別々の生存曲線が得られます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:76
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "重み"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:79
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr ""
"ケースの重みに使う変数を選びます。各観測はこれに応じて重みづけられます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:89
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "打ち切りの要約"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:90
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr "データの打ち切りの状態をまとめた表を作成します。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:95
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "検定"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:100
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-rank (Mantel-Haenszel)"
msgstr "ログランク (Mantel-Haenszel)"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:101
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Log-Rank (Mantel-Haenszel) test to compare survival curves "
"across strata."
msgstr ""
"層の間で生存曲線を比較するログランク (Mantel-Haenszel) 検定を含めます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:107
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Peto and Peto"
msgstr "Peto and Peto"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:108
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Peto and Peto modification of the Gehan-Wilcoxon test to compare "
"survival curves across strata."
msgstr ""
"層の間で生存曲線を比較する、Gehan-Wilcoxon検定のPeto and Peto修正を含めます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:114
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Flemming-Harrington"
msgstr "Flemming-Harrington"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:115
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Fleming-Harrington test to compare survival curves across "
"strata., with a customizable rho parameter."
msgstr ""
"層の間で生存曲線を比較するFleming-Harrington検定を含めます。rho母数は変更でき"
"ます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:120
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rho"
msgstr "Rho"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:124
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the rho parameter for the Fleming-Harrington test, controlling the "
"weight given to different time points (values between 0 and 1)."
msgstr ""
"Fleming-Harrington検定のrho母数を設定します。異なる時点に与える重みを調整しま"
"す (0から1の値)。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:132
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Life table"
msgstr "生命表"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:133
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Generate a life table summarizing survival data at specified time intervals."
msgstr "指定した時間区間ごとに生存データを要約した生命表を作成します。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:139
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps type"
msgstr "ステップの種類"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:140
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the method to define intervals for the life table: Default, "
"Quantiles, or Fixed size. Quantiles uses empirical quantiles of the observed "
"times, including censored times, after frequency weights are applied; these "
"are not quantiles of the estimated survival distribution."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:143
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "デフォルト"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:144
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Quantiles"
msgstr "分位点"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:145
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed size"
msgstr "固定幅"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:152
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Number"
msgstr "個数"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:155
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify the number of intervals when using Quantiles as the steps type."
msgstr "ステップの種類に分位点を使うときの区間の個数を指定します。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:161
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Round steps"
msgstr "ステップを丸める"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:164
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Round the interval boundaries to the nearest integer when using Quantiles "
"steps."
msgstr "分位点のステップを使うとき、区間の境界を最も近い整数に丸めます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:171
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "From"
msgstr "開始"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:175
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the starting time for intervals when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "固定幅のステップを使うときの区間の開始時間を設定します。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:181
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "幅"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:185
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Define the size of each interval when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "固定幅のステップを使うときの各区間の幅を定めます。"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:192
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "To"
msgstr "終了"

#: inst/qml/NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:196
msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the ending time for intervals when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "固定幅のステップを使うときの区間の終了時間を設定します。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:26
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis models survival times as a finite mixture of components from "
"the same parametric family. Constrained maximum likelihood imposes the "
"specified minimum standard deviation of log survival time in every "
"component. Several starting values, each refined by EM iterations, are used; "
"the converged solution with the highest likelihood satisfying the bound is "
"reported."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:26
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis performs a parametric mixture survival analysis. The survival "
"times are modeled as a finite mixture of components from the same parametric "
"family. The likelihood is maximized directly from several starting values "
"(each refined by a few EM iterations). The non-degenerate solution with the "
"highest likelihood is reported. If all solutions are degenerate, the best of "
"them is reported with a warning."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:45
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:51
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:57
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:63
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:69
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:75
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:82
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:87
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:93
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:98
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:105
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:107
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the mixture model. "
"The covariates affect the location parameter of each component with separate "
"coefficients."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:114
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:116
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the mixture model. "
"The factors affect the location parameter of each component with separate "
"coefficients."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:123
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:126
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:133
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:136
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for subgroup analysis, allowing for separate analyses "
"within each subgroup."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:147
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:150
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select right-censored data, counting-process data with entry and exit times, "
"or interval-censored data (including left-censored observations)."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:154
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:162
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:169
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:172
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"If interval censoring is selected, the following coding needs to be used: "
"left-censored data is represented as (NA, t2), right-censored data as (t1, "
"NA), exact data as (t, t), and interval-censored data as (t1, t2)."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:179
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:180
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:191
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:193
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parametric distribution of the mixture components (all components "
"come from the same distribution). All fits and display results for all "
"'Selected parametric families' in the 'Advanced' section. 'Best AIC' and "
"'Best BIC' fit all `Selected parametric families` in the Advanced section "
"and display the results only for a parametric family with the lowest AIC/"
"BIC. Families without a closed-form weighted fit (gamma, Gompertz, and the "
"generalized families) are considerably slower to estimate."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:196
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:445
