msgid "Best BIC"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:218
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Components"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:220
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the number of mixture components. 'All' fits and displays results for "
"one up to the maximum number of components set in the 'Advanced' section. "
"'Best AIC' and 'Best BIC' fit the same models and display the results only "
"for the number of components with the lowest AIC/BIC. A fixed number of "
"components is not limited by the maximum number of components."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:236
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:247
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:257
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interpret model"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:260
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the model to interpret. Defaults to the last specified model. "
"Alternatives are 'All' which produces results for all of the specified "
"models or 'Best' which produces results for the best fitting model based on "
"either AIC or BIC. The selection proceeds within each subgroup from the "
"distribution to the number of components to the model: 'Best' keeps the "
"level of the best fitting model across all remaining distributions, numbers "
"of components, and models, and 'All' selects separately within each of its "
"levels (e.g., all distributions with the best number of components and the "
"best model within each distribution)."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:282
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with information about the model fit. The BIC uses the "
"number of observations (including censored observations and weighted by the "
"case weights) as the sample size."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:287
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:361
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:498
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mixture"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:291
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean and median"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:294
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the mean and the median lifetime of each mixture "
"component. They correspond to the reference level of factors and zero value "
"of covariates. The mixing probabilities and the parameters of the components "
"are reported in the coefficients summary. Components are ordered by their "
"median lifetime."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:299
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Classification"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:302
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the number and proportion of observations assigned to "
"each component based on their highest posterior probability, the mean "
"posterior probability of the assigned observations, and the relative entropy "
"of the classification."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:316
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the quantiles at which survival times are predicted: evenly spaced "
"Quantiles, a Sequence, or Custom probabilities."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:317
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of quantiles of the predicted survival when using "
"Quantiles as the steps type."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:318
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the time points for prediction tables: Equal spacing, a Sequence, or "
"Custom times. Time plots place unrounded points adaptively within the "
"selected range."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:319
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define the time increment when using Sequence steps. Leaving this blank uses "
"one tenth of the selected time range."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:320
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify custom time points for predictions."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:325
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:337
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:417
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Merge plots across components"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:330
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival time across the numbers of components into a "
"single plot. Only available when all numbers of components are displayed and "
"no model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:342
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival probabilities, hazard, cumulative hazard, and "
"restricted mean survival across the numbers of components into a single "
"plot. Only available when all numbers of components are displayed and no "
"model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:349
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:356
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted time"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:365
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimation diagnostics"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:368
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the diagnostics of the estimation of each mixture "
"model: the number of starting values, how many of them reached the reported "
"solution, the log-likelihood of the reported and of the next best distinct "
"solution, the number of degenerate candidate solutions, the effective sample "
"size and the effective number of events of the smallest component, optimizer "
"convergence, and whether the Hessian of the likelihood is positive definite."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:374
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Component plot"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:376
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a plot with the fitted mixture and its components. The components "
"are evaluated at the same covariate values as the predictions."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:382
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:384
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the displayed function: the survival probability of the mixture and "
"of each component, the failure probability of the mixture and of each "
"component, the density of the mixture and the weighted density of each "
"component (which sum to the mixture density), or the hazard of the mixture "
"and of each component."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:387
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Survival probability"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:388
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Failure probability"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:389
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Density"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:390
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:397
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Observed data"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:399
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Overlay a histogram of the observed time distribution on the fitted "
"densities. For right-censored data, bin probabilities are estimated with "
"Kaplan-Meier and any unobserved tail probability is retained. The fitted "
"curves use the prediction covariate settings; the histogram describes the "
"full sample within each subgroup."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:420
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the probability plots across the numbers of components into a single "
"plot. Only available when all numbers of components are displayed and no "
"model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:434
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:438
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Selected Parametric Distributions"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:504
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Constrain component spread"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:506
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Fit by constrained maximum likelihood with a minimum standard deviation of "
"the natural logarithm of survival time in every component, including one-"
"component models. Available for log-normal, Weibull, log-logistic, and gamma "
"distributions; other distributions are deselected. Checkbox choices made in "
"Selected Parametric Distributions before turning the constraint on are "
"restored when it is turned off again, provided the analysis form has not "
"been reloaded. When the bound is active, point estimates remain available "
"but standard errors, confidence intervals, covariance estimates, and regular "
"inferential tests are not reported."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:512
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Minimum spread"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:514
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Relative"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:515
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Absolute"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:518
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the minimum log-time standard deviation relative to an unconstrained one-"
"component fit of the same distribution, or as an absolute value. The "
"reference fit uses the same data, predictors, censoring, and weights and is "
"computed separately for each model and subgroup."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:524
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:537
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Minimum log-time SD"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:531
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set a positive percentage of the unconstrained one-component model's log-"
"time standard deviation as the minimum for every component. The default is "
"1%. For models with predictors, the reference is the conditional "
"distribution's log-time standard deviation. For delayed entry, it refers to "
"the distribution before conditioning on entry."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:544
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set a positive lower bound, up to 100, on the standard deviation of the "
"natural logarithm of survival time. Choose a minimum justified by the "
"application and check sensitivity to other values; 0.1 is an editable "
"preset, not a universal recommendation. The bound is unchanged when the "
"units of survival time change. For delayed entry, it bounds the component "
"distribution before conditioning on entry."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:552
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum components"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:557
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of components fitted when 'All', 'Best AIC', or 'Best "
"BIC' is selected as the number of components."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:562
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Starting Values"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:563
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the starting values of the constrained mixture estimation. The "
"converged solution with the highest likelihood satisfying the minimum "
"component spread is reported. More starting values reduce the risk of a "
"local optimum at a higher computational cost."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:563
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the starting values of the mixture estimation. The likelihood is "
"maximized directly from every selected starting value and the non-degenerate "
"solution with the highest likelihood is reported. If all solutions are "
"degenerate, the best of them is reported with a warning. More starting "
"values make it more likely that the reported solution is the global maximum, "
"at a proportionally higher computational cost."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:568
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "K-means"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:570
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from a k-means clustering of the log survival times. The likelihood is "
"maximized directly from this starting value."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:576
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Quantiles"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:578
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from partitions of the survival times by their quantiles: a partition "
"into groups of equal size and partitions that isolate the tails (the lowest "
"and the highest 15% for two components, 15/70/15% for three components, and "
"10/40/40/10% for four components). The likelihood is maximized directly from "
"each of these starting values."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:584
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Split of the previous solution"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:586
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from the solution with one component fewer, splitting each of its "
"components into a lower and an upper half. The likelihood is maximized "
"directly from each of these starting values. The solution with one component "
"fewer is estimated for this purpose when it is not part of the analysis."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:592
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Random"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:595
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from random centres drawn from the observed event times, assigning "
"each observation to the nearest centre. The likelihood is maximized directly "
"from each of these starting values. Random starting values are the main "
"protection against reporting a local optimum."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:604
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the number of random starting values."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:612
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "EM iterations"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:616
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the number of EM iterations that refine each starting value before the "
"likelihood is maximized directly. The state after the first and after the "
"last EM iteration are both used as starting values of the direct "
"maximization."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:624
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Output Formatting"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:629
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include full dataset in subgroup analysis"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:632
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset output in the subgroup analysis. This option is "
"only available when the subgroup analysis is selected."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:638
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare models across distributions"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:641
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Compare models across distributions. This option is only available when the "
"multiple models and parametric distributions are specified."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:647
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare models across components"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:650
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Compare models across the numbers of components. This option is only "
"available when multiple models and numbers of components are specified."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:656
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Always display model information"
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:658
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Always display model information (distribution, number of components, and "
"model name) in output tables."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:26
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "This analysis performs a parametric survival analysis."
msgstr "この分析はパラメトリック生存分析を行います。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:43
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr "区間の開始"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:49
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr ""
"観測区間の開始時間を表す変数を選びます。打ち切りの種類が区間または計数過程の"
"ときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:55
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr "区間の終了"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:61
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr ""
"観測区間の終了時間を表す変数を選びます。打ち切りの種類が区間または計数過程の"
"ときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:67
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "イベントまでの時間"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:73
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:80
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "イベントの状態"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:85
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr ""
"イベントの状態を示す変数を選びます。各観測がイベントなのか打ち切りなのかを指"
"定するものです。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:91
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "イベントの指示値"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:96
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr ""
"イベントが発生したことを示す値を、イベントの状態の変数の中から指定します。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:103
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "共変量"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:105
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the parametric "
"survival model."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:112
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "要因"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:114
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the parametric "
"survival model."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:121
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "重み"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:124
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr ""
"ケースの重みに使う変数を選びます。各観測はこれに応じて重みづけられます。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:131
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:134
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for subgroup analysis, allowing for separate analyses "
"within each subgroup."
msgstr ""
"サブグループ分析に使う変数を選びます。サブグループごとに別々の分析ができま"
"す。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:145
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "打ち切りの種類"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:148
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select right-censored data, counting-process data with delayed entry, or "
"interval-censored data."
msgstr ""

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:152
#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricPredictions.qml:188
#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:187
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:160
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "計数過程"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:167
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "区間"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:170
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"If interval censoring is selected, the following coding needs to be used: "
"left-censored data is represented as (NA, t2), right-censored data as (t1, "
"NA), exact data as (t, t), and interval-censored data as (t1, t2)."
msgstr ""
"区間打ち切りを選んだ場合は、次のコーディングを使う必要があります。左打ち切り"
"のデータは (NA, t2)、右打ち切りのデータは (t1, NA)、正確に分かっているデータ"
"は (t, t)、区間打ち切りのデータは (t1, t2) と表します。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:177
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "打ち切りの要約"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:178
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr "データの打ち切りの状態をまとめた表を作成します。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:186
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:188
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parametric distribution for the analysis. All fits and display "
"results for all 'Selected parametric families' in the 'Advanced' section. "
"'Best AIC' and 'Best BIC' fit all `Selected parametric families` in the "
"Advanced section and display the results only for a parametric family with "
"the lowest AIC/BIC."
msgstr ""
"分析に用いるパラメトリック分布を選びます。「すべて」は「詳細」の節にある「選"
"択したパラメトリック分布」をすべて当てはめて結果を表示します。「AIC最良」と"
"「BIC最良」も「詳細」の節にある「選択したパラメトリック分布」をすべて当てはめ"
"ますが、AIC/BICが最小のパラメトリック族の結果だけを表示します。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:191
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:296
#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:50
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "指数"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:192
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:297
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "ガンマ"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:193
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:298
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized F"
msgstr "一般化F"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:194
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:299
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized gamma"
msgstr "一般化ガンマ"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:195
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:300
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gompertz"
msgstr "ゴンペルツ"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:196
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:301
#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:52
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-logistic"
msgstr "対数ロジスティック"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:197
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:302
#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:51
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-normal"
msgstr "対数正規"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:198
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:303
#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:49
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weibull"
msgstr "ワイブル"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:199
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:304
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized gamma (original)"
msgstr "一般化ガンマ (オリジナル)"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:200
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:305
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized F (original)"
msgstr "一般化F (オリジナル)"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:201
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:239
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "すべて"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:202
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:240
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best AIC"
msgstr "AIC最良"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:203
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:241
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best BIC"
msgstr "BIC最良"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:209
#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:220
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "モデル"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:230
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interpret model"
msgstr "解釈するモデル"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:233
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the model to interpret. Defaults to the last specified model. "
"Alternatives are 'All' which produces results for all of the specified "
"models or 'Best' which produces results for the best fitting model based on "
"either AIC or BIC. If distribution and model selection is specified "
"simultanously, the best model within the best performing distribution is "
"going to be selected. If model selection is specified while all "
"distributions are selected, the best model within each distribution is going "
"to be selected."
msgstr ""
"解釈するモデルを選びます。既定では最後に指定したモデルになります。「すべて」"
"を選ぶと指定したすべてのモデルの結果が、「最良」を選ぶとAICまたはBICで最もよ"
"く当てはまったモデルの結果が得られます。分布の選択とモデルの選択を同時に指定"
"した場合は、最も良い分布の中で最も良いモデルが選ばれます。すべての分布を選ん"
"だうえでモデルの選択を指定した場合は、各分布の中で最も良いモデルが選ばれま"
"す。"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:266
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "診断"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:288
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "詳細"

#: inst/qml/ParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:292
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
