"Merge the probability plots across distributions into a single plot. Only "
"available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""
"確率プロットを分布をまたいで1つのプロットに統合します。モデル選択を行っていな"
"いときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:113
msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence interval bounds for the fitted probability curve."
msgstr "当てはめた確率曲線の信頼区間の境界を含めます。"

#: inst/qml/qml_components/ParametricProbabilityPlot.qml:119
