"ます。"

#: inst/qml/qml_components/SurvivalPlot.qml:147
msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "テーマ"

#: inst/qml/qml_components/SurvivalPlot.qml:148
msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the theme for the plot's appearance: JASP for the default look or "
"ggsurvfit for the ggsurvfit package style."
msgstr ""
"プロットの見た目のテーマを選びます。既定の見た目ならJASP、ggsurvfitパッケージ"
"の様式ならggsurvfitです。"

#: inst/qml/qml_components/SurvivalPlot.qml:151
msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "JASP"
msgstr "JASP"

#: inst/qml/qml_components/SurvivalPlot.qml:152
msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "ggsurvfit"
msgstr "ggsurvfit"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:27
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis performs a Cox proportional hazards regression, a statistical "
"method used in survival analysis to examine the relationship between the "
"time until an event occurs (such as death or failure) and one or more "
"predictor variables. It helps you understand how different factors influence "
"the risk or hazard of the event happening at any given time. The Cox model "
"is particularly useful because it can handle censored data (when the event "
"has not occurred for some subjects during the study period) and does not "
"require assumptions about the baseline hazard function."
msgstr ""
"この分析はCox比例ハザード回帰を行います。これは生存分析で使われる統計手法で、"
"イベント (死亡や故障など) が起こるまでの時間と、1つ以上の予測変数との関係を調"
"べるものです。さまざまな要因が、任意の時点でイベントが起こるリスクすなわちハ"
"ザードにどう影響するかを理解できます。Coxモデルは、打ち切りのあるデータ (調査"
"期間中に一部の対象でイベントが起こらなかった場合) を扱うことができ、ベースラ"
"インハザード関数について仮定を置く必要がないため、とりわけ有用です。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:42
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr "区間の開始"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:48
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr ""
"観測区間の開始時間を表す変数を選びます。打ち切りの種類が計数過程のときだけ使"
"えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:54
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr "区間の終了"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:60
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr ""
"観測区間の終了時間を表す変数を選びます。打ち切りの種類が計数過程のときだけ使"
"えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:66
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "イベントまでの時間"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:72
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr ""
"イベントの発生または打ち切りまでの時間を表す変数を選びます。打ち切りの種類が"
"右のときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:79
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "イベントの状態"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:82
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr ""
"イベントの状態を示す変数を選びます。各観測がイベントなのか打ち切りなのかを指"
"定するものです。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:88
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "イベントの指示値"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:91
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr ""
"イベントが発生したことを示す値を、イベントの状態の変数の中から指定します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:97
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "共変量"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:99
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the Cox regression "
"model."
msgstr "連続変数を共変量として加え、Cox回帰モデルに含めます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:105
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "要因"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:107
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the Cox regression "
"model."
msgstr "カテゴリカル変数を要因として加え、Cox回帰モデルに含めます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:114
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "重み"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:117
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr ""
"ケースの重みに使う変数を選びます。各観測はこれに応じて重みづけられます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:128
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "打ち切りの種類"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:131
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of censoring in your data: Right censoring or Counting "
"process."
msgstr "データの打ち切りの種類を選びます。右打ち切りか計数過程かを選べます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:135
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:143
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "計数過程"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:152
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "打ち切りの要約"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:153
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr "データの打ち切りの状態をまとめた表を作成します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:161
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:250
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:164
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Efron"
msgstr "Efron"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:165
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Breslow"
msgstr "Breslow"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:166
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Exact"
msgstr "厳密"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:168
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the method for handling tied event times: Efron, Breslow, or Exact."
msgstr "同じイベント時間の扱い方を選びます。Efron、Breslow、厳密から選べます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:173
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata, Cluster, and Frailty"
msgstr "層、クラスタ、フレイルティ"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:188
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata"
msgstr "層"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:190
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to define strata, allowing separate baseline hazard "
"functions for each stratum."
msgstr ""
"層を定める変数を選びます。層ごとに別々のベースラインハザード関数が得られま"
"す。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:209
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "クラスタ"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:212
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable to define clusters of correlated observations for robust "
"variance estimation. Disabled when a Frailty variable is specified or Method "
"is set to Exact."
msgstr ""
"頑健な分散推定のため、相関のある観測のクラスタを定める変数を選びます。フレイ"
"ルティの変数を指定しているとき、または方法が厳密のときは使えません。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:220
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:229
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Frailty"
msgstr "フレイルティ"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:223
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for frailty to model unobserved heterogeneity using random "
"effects. Disabled when a Cluster variable is specified."
msgstr ""
"観測されない異質性を変量効果でモデル化するため、フレイルティに使う変数を選び"
"ます。クラスタの変数を指定しているときは使えません。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:236
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:237
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the distribution for the frailty term: Gamma, Gaussian, or T "
"distribution. Only available when a Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr ""
"フレイルティ項の分布を選びます。ガンマ、正規、t分布から選べます。フレイルティ"
"の変数を指定しているときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:240
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "ガンマ"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:241
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "正規"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:242
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "T"
msgstr "T"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:251
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the estimation method for the frailty distribution. Options vary "
"based on the chosen Distribution."
msgstr ""
"フレイルティ分布の推定方法を選びます。選べる方法は選んだ分布によって変わりま"
"す。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:255
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "EM"
msgstr "EM"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:256
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:262
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:267
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC"
msgstr "AIC"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:257
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:263
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:268
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "固定"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:261
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "REML"
msgstr "REML"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:276
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:296
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:311
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Df"
msgstr "Df"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:280
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the degrees of freedom (Df) for the T frailty distribution. Only visible "
"when Distribution is set to T."
msgstr ""
"Tフレイルティ分布の自由度 (Df) を設定します。分布がTのときだけ表示されます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:291
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "固定する母数"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:292
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parameter to fix in the frailty model when Method is set to "
"Fixed: Theta or Df."
msgstr ""
"方法が固定のとき、フレイルティモデルで固定する母数を選びます。ThetaかDfかを選"
"べます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:295
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:302
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Theta"
msgstr "Theta"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:306
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value of Theta to fix in the frailty model. Only visible when "
"Fix is set to Theta."
msgstr ""
"フレイルティモデルで固定するThetaの値を指定します。固定する母数がThetaのとき"
"だけ表示されます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:315
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the degrees of freedom (Df) to fix in the frailty model. Only "
"visible when Fix is set to Df."
msgstr ""
"フレイルティモデルで固定する自由度 (Df) を指定します。固定する母数がDfのとき"
"だけ表示されます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:323
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "モデル"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:332
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Components"
msgstr "コンポーネント"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:347
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計量"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:355
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model fit"
msgstr "モデルフィット"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:356
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include overall model fit statistics in the output."
msgstr "モデル全体の適合度の統計量を出力に含めます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:361
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "検定"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:362
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Test all parameters of the H₁ model."
msgstr "H₁モデルのすべての母数を検定します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:367
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Likelihood ratio"
msgstr "尤度比"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:368
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include the Likelihood Ratio Test in the model summary."
msgstr "モデルの要約に尤度比検定を含めます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:375
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Wald"
msgstr "Wald"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:376
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Wald Test in the model summary. Disabled when a Frailty variable "
"is specified."
msgstr ""
"モデルの要約にWald検定を含めます。フレイルティの変数を指定しているときは使え"
"ません。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:383
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Score (log-rank)"
msgstr "スコア (ログランク)"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:384
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Score (Log-Rank) Test in the model summary. Disabled when a "
"Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr ""
"モデルの要約にスコア (ログランク) 検定を含めます。フレイルティの変数を指定し"
"ているときは使えません。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:391
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "係数"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:398
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "推定値"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:400
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the estimated coefficients in the model output."
msgstr "推定された係数をモデルの出力に表示します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:405
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Vovk-Sellke maximum p-ratio"
msgstr "Vovk-Sellke maximum p比"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:406
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include the Vovk-Sellke maximum p-ratio for each coefficient."
msgstr "各係数にVovk-Sellke maximum p比を含めます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:413
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard ratio estimates"
msgstr "ハザード比の推定値"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:415
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the hazard ratio estimates (exponentiated coefficients)."
msgstr "ハザード比の推定値 (係数を指数変換したもの) を表示します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:420
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include frailty"
msgstr "フレイルティを含める"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:422
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the effect of frailty in hazard ratio estimates. Only available when "
"a Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr ""
"ハザード比の推定値にフレイルティの効果を含めます。フレイルティの変数を指定し"
"ているときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:429
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "信頼区間"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:432
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the coefficients."
msgstr "係数の信頼区間を含めます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:437
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the confidence level (e.g., 95%) for the confidence intervals."
msgstr "信頼区間の信頼水準 (例えば95%) を設定します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:446
#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:469
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "プロット"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:453
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "診断"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:457
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Proportional Hazards"
msgstr "比例ハザード性"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:462
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Table"
msgstr "表"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:463
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Provide a table to test the proportional hazards assumption."
msgstr "比例ハザード性の仮定を検定する表を出力します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:470
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generate plots to assess the proportional hazards assumption."
msgstr "比例ハザード性の仮定を評価するプロットを作成します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:476
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Transformation"
msgstr "変換"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:477
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the transformation for time in proportional hazards testing: KM, "
"Rank, or Identity."
msgstr ""
"比例ハザード性の検定で用いる時間の変換を選びます。KM、順位、恒等から選べま"
"す。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:480
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "KM"
msgstr "KM"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:481
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank"
msgstr "ランク"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:482
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "同一"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:489
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Test terms"
msgstr "項を検定する"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:490
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Test the proportional hazards assumption for individual model terms (instead "
"of coefficients)."
msgstr ""
"係数ではなく、モデルの個々の項について比例ハザード性の仮定を検定します。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:497
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "残差プロット"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:502
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. time"
msgstr "残差 対 時間"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:504
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus time to detect non-proportional hazards. Available "
"only for Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr ""
"比例ハザード性が成り立たないことを見つけるため、残差を時間に対してプロットし"
"ます。マルチンゲール残差またはデビアンス残差のときだけ使えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:510
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predictors"
msgstr "残差 対 予測変数"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:512
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predictors to assess model fit. Available when model "
"terms are specified."
msgstr ""
"モデルの適合を評価するため、残差を予測変数に対してプロットします。モデルの項"
"が指定されているときに使えます。"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:518
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted survival"
msgstr "残差 対 予測された生存"

#: inst/qml/SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis.qml:520
msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predicted survival probabilities. Available only for "
"Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr ""
